TextEncodingDetection
=====================

TextEncodingDetection/Uchardet/*.cs is a C# port of the universal charset detector ("uchardet")
as bundled in Notepad++ (https://github.com/notepad-plus-plus/notepad-plus-plus,
PowerEditor/src/uchardet, at commit ee7135572a2457edc769cc84878e2d4b2183e90c). That code is
Mozilla's universalchardet (via https://github.com/BYVoid/uchardet), whose files carry this
license block:

