ICU charset detector
====================

TextEncodingDetection/Icu/*.cs is a C# port of the ICU4C charset detector (ucsdet) from ICU
release-74-2 (https://github.com/unicode-org/icu, icu4c/source/i18n: csdetect.cpp, csmatch.cpp,
csrecog.cpp, inputext.cpp, csrutf8.cpp, csrucode.cpp, csrsbcs.cpp, csrmbcs.cpp, csr2022.cpp).
IcuTables.g.cs holds the n-gram, byte-map and common-character tables extracted from those files.

